    <title>
        <en>AgForward Financial Cooperative</en>
    </title>

    <description>
        <en><![CDATA[
AgForward is an agriculture-focused financial system for Farming Simulator 25.

Current development focuses on the hardened shared financial core: fail-safe persistence, immutable ledger history, native liabilities, purpose-aware accounting, server-authoritative mutation, settlement idempotency, crop-input classification, reporting foundations, and optional Red Tape integration.
        ]]></en>
    </description>

